<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Equikor breaks even at half yr, no div.</title>
<headline>Equikor breaks even at half yr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib loss (cts) none	  vs 8.13</p>
<p>    Attrib loss		0.10	  vs 22.47</p>
<p>    Finance charges	  none	  vs 0.46</p>
<p>    Operating loss	   0.10	  vs 22.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		   0.05	  vs 4.97</p>
<p>Full name:  Equikor Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	0.42	  vs none</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said negotiations for the purchase of a large property portfolio were expected to be finalised within one month.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
